Tandem: every file in this folder was copied from iTerm2 (https://github.com/gnachman/iTerm2,
commit 64791fc) and is used under iTerm2's license. COPYING-iTerm2 is iTerm2's COPYING (GPL v2
or later) and LICENSE-iTerm2 is iTerm2's LICENSE, the full license text, both copied verbatim
from iTerm2's tree.

Which files are iTerm2's, and where they come from:

  framer.py
      iTerm2 OtherResources/framer.py, byte for byte.
  shell_integration/bash-si-loader
      iTerm2 OtherResources/bash-si-loader, byte for byte.
  shell_integration/.zshenv
      iTerm2 OtherResources/.zshenv, byte for byte.
  shell_integration/iterm2-shell-integration-loader.fish
      iTerm2 OtherResources/vendor_conf.d/iterm2-shell-integration-loader.fish, byte for byte.
  conductor.sh
      iTerm2 submodules/iTerm2-shell-integration/ssh-helpers/conductor.sh, byte for byte.
  shell_integration/iterm2_shell_integration.bash, .zsh, .fish and .xonsh
      iTerm2 submodules/iTerm2-shell-integration/shell_integration/bash, zsh, fish and
      xonsh, byte for byte.

submodules/iTerm2-shell-integration is iTerm2's own shell integration repository
(https://github.com/gnachman/iTerm2-shell-integration, commit bbf5a33, the one iTerm2's commit
64791fc pins). It is GPL v2 like iTerm2 (its LICENSE file is the GPL v2 text).

Any file in this folder not listed above is Tandem's own.
